| OriginalAirDate={{Start date|1953|6|1}}
| ShortSummary=When Lucy buys a new sofa and coffee table without Ricky's permission, he says she will have to pay for it out of her allowance. To save money, Lucy attempts to make her own dress and gives herself a home perm, which soon makes Ricky regret his words. 
