| OriginalAirDate={{Start date|1953|6|8}}
| ShortSummary=Determined to prove to friends from her [[Contract bridge|bridge]] club that she and Ricky have not grown apart, Lucy starts spending all of her time with Ricky. When she wants to join him and Fred on a summer camping trip, Ricky takes Lucy into the wilderness for a practice trip to make her hate camping, but Lucy and Ethel team up to thwart his plan.
| LineColor=E7CC58
}}
