| OriginalAirDate={{Start date|1953|10|19}}
| ShortSummary=Lucy and Ethel are going to appear on TV with their women's club, and choose to sing [[Cole Porter]]'s "Friendship" together. In addition, Lucy manages to use reverse psychology to get Ricky to host the event. All is well until the two women buy the same dress for the occasion, sparking a rivalry between them.
