| ShortSummary=The Ricardos have decided they are not going to brag about their baby Little Ricky. That changes when Carolyn and Charlie Appleby start to brag about their own baby, Stevie. A television appearance Charlie offers to Ricky is jeopardized when Lucy and Carolyn end up in a hostile feud over the children.
