| ShortSummary=Because Ethel is ashamed to host a women's club meeting in her drab apartment and Ricky refuses to let Lucy host it in theirs, the Ricardos offer to help the Mertzes redecorate their apartment, including painting the walls and reupholstering the furniture (with disastrous results). Ricky ends up having to go back on his promise to buy Lucy a mink stole in order to replace their furniture, which they gave to the Mertzes to replace what was ruined.
