| ShortSummary=Ricky and Fred anger Lucy and Ethel by wearing their old clothes in public. The wives secretly sell their husbands' clothes to a second-hand clothes dealer but the men find their clothes there and buy them all back.  In the meantime, Ricky receives an honor as one of the best-dressed men in the country and wants to surprise Lucy with the news in public. Summoned to the club without knowing the reason, Lucy and Ethel try to teach their husbands a lesson by showing up in ragged clothes, only to find Ricky and Fred dressed to the nines and a photographer there to take pictures.
