| OriginalAirDate={{Start date|1954|1|18}}
| ShortSummary=Ricky has a week off from the club, so he decides to take care of Little Ricky, who wanders into the Mertzes' apartment while Ricky is distracted. Finding Little Ricky, Lucy decides to teach Ricky a lesson that he will never forget by calling to ask about the baby and watching Ricky panic when he cannot find him. However, Fred finds Little Ricky in his own apartment and brings him back to the Ricardos' without anyone else knowing. Lucy, Ricky and Ethel are confused when they find Little Ricky back in his crib.
| LineColor=8AC1FF
}}
