| OriginalAirDate={{Start date|1954|2|22}}
| ShortSummary=Ricky bets Lucy that he can control his temper longer than she can keep from buying a new hat. However, while at the hat store, Lucy cannot help herself and orders a new hat. She then attempts to get Ricky to lose his temper before the new hat is delivered. Ricky manages to keep his temper in check despite Lucy's best efforts. However, when trying to hire a new performer at his club, Ricky ends up saving a large amount of money by keeping his cool, and tells Lucy he will buy her a new hat himself as a thank you. However, the hat she ordered arrives at that very moment and Ricky realizes what was going on.
